# --- Gitallow Pattern ---
# Ignore everything, then allow tracked file types explicitly.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!.github/**
!*.lean
!*.md
!*.json
!*.toml
!*.sh
!*.yml
!*.jl
!justfile
!lean-toolchain

# Build outputs and local state
.lake/
generated/
.git/
.DS_Store

# Local assistant and planning files (never committed)
.claude/
.specify/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
spec.md
specs/
